      "severity": "P0_CANDIDATE",
      "detail": "Primary-only disclosure/export/close is enforced in relationship grants and nondelegable issuance catalog, but decideCase supervisory mandate branch accepts matching arbitrary power after scoped/capacity checks. assessMandate rejects read_privileged, not these primary-only powers. Default supervisory template omits all three; custom rule draft stores caller-provided allowedPowers, so default-template tests do not establish a universal ceiling. Export route calls findReadableCase with kernel action. Prove synthetic kernel outcome and real issuance/DB reachability separately before changing policy or asserting product exploitability.",
